<title>DENMARK: Moeller shares soar 4-6 pct.</title>
<headline>Moeller shares soar 4-6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping and oil group A.P. Moeller D/S 1912 and D/S Svendborg shares soared in Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Tuesday, bolstered by Monday' s Wall Street rises in oil stock.</p>
<p>At 1310 gmt, D/S 1912 B had risen 4.8 percent to 195,000 crowns, while D/S Svendborg B traded 6.4 percent up at 283,000 crowns.</p>
<p>Dealers also said that Moeller shares had been undervalued for a time. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
